    <briefdescription>
<para>A type that represents either a value of type T or an <ref refid="classcslt_1_1Error" kindref="compound">Error</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Expected&lt;T&gt; stores both the value and error in a fixed-size structure. No dynamic allocation is used - all storage is static.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>T</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type of the expected value</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Example Usage:</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">Expected&lt;int&gt;<sp/>divide(int<sp/>a,<sp/>int<sp/>b)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Expected&lt;int&gt;<sp/>result;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>if<sp/>(b<sp/>==<sp/>0)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>result.setError(DivByZeroError());</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>result;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>result.setValue(a<sp/>/<sp/>b);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>return<sp/>result;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Expected&lt;int&gt;<sp/>result<sp/>=<sp/>divide(10,<sp/>2);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">if<sp/>(result.hasValue())<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>printf(&quot;Result:<sp/>%d\n&quot;,<sp/>result.value());</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}<sp/>else<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>printf(&quot;Error:<sp/>%s\n&quot;,<sp/>result.error().what());</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
